       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CLASSES.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           CLASS VOWEL IS "AEIOU"
           CLASS HEXDIGIT IS "0" THRU "9" "A" THRU "F"
           CLASS BACKWARD IS "Z" THRU "X"
           CLASS ORDINAL IS 66 THRU 68.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 W PIC X(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE "AEIO" TO W
           IF W VOWEL DISPLAY "1 YES" ELSE DISPLAY "1 NO" END-IF
           MOVE "AEIB" TO W
           IF W IS VOWEL DISPLAY "2 YES" ELSE DISPLAY "2 NO" END-IF
           MOVE "09AF" TO W
           IF W HEXDIGIT DISPLAY "3 YES" ELSE DISPLAY "3 NO" END-IF
           MOVE "09AG" TO W
           IF W NOT HEXDIGIT DISPLAY "4 YES" ELSE DISPLAY "4 NO" END-IF
           MOVE "XYZX" TO W
           IF W BACKWARD DISPLAY "5 YES" ELSE DISPLAY "5 NO" END-IF
           MOVE "ABCB" TO W
           IF W ORDINAL DISPLAY "6 YES" ELSE DISPLAY "6 NO" END-IF
           STOP RUN.
